<section class="inner-hero legal"><span class="eyebrow">LEGAL / COOKIES</span><h1>Cookie <em>Policy.</em></h1><p>Explain how your production website uses cookies and similar technologies.</p></section>
<section class="section legal-content"><h2>Essential cookies</h2><p>These may be required for core site functions, security and preferences.</p><h2>Analytics cookies</h2><p>If enabled, analytics can help understand traffic, page performance and user journeys.</p><h2>Advertising cookies</h2><p>If Google Ads, Meta Ads or remarketing tools are enabled, their cookies or identifiers may be used according to the configured service.</p><h2>Managing cookies</h2><p>Visitors can control cookies through browser settings. If consent management is required for your target markets, add an appropriate consent banner before enabling non-essential tracking.</p></section>
